  "<section class=\"course-page\" id=\"lesson-11\" data-chapter11-complete=\"brain-investigation\" hidden=\"\">\n<div class=\"p2-topic\">\n<header class=\"page-header\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-940\">Learn \u00b7 Chapter 11</p>\n<h1 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-941\">Studying the brain</h1>\n<p class=\"lesson-question\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-942\">How do researchers study brain structure and function?</p>\n<div class=\"goal-strip\"><div><p class=\"section-label\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-01\">Learning goal</p><p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-02\">I can compare the information provided by brain injuries, stimulation, dissection, MRI and PET.</p></div>\n<div><p class=\"section-label\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-03\">Before you begin</p><p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-04\">Review the main brain structures and their functions.</p></div></div>\n<details class=\"page-guide\">\n<summary data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-guide-summary\"><strong>How to complete this lesson</strong> \u2014 Learn \u2192 practise \u2192 required check \u2192 finish</summary>\n<div>\n<ol>\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-guide-01\"><strong>Start with the lesson.</strong> Read the learning goal and \u201cBefore you begin,\u201d then work through the explanation, diagrams and examples below. The embedded textbook is optional support: open it when you want another explanation or a closer look at a figure.</li>\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-guide-02\"><strong>Use the learning goal and starting reminder.</strong> The learning goal above tells you what you must be able to explain. Read \u201cBefore you begin\u201d next to connect this lesson to what you already know.</li>\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-guide-03\"><strong>Work through the online lesson in order.</strong> Read each teaching section and study its diagrams, examples and comparisons. Select an underlined biology term when you need its meaning. Use the video or Vocabulary help when an idea is still unclear.</li>\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-guide-04\"><strong>Complete the required chapter check.</strong> Open the check near the bottom and select Start. For multiple choice, select Check answer; a correct answer unlocks the related writing. Answer in your own words and select Save written response for every response box.</li>\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-guide-05\"><strong>Submit only when the required work is complete.</strong> Check that every required item has been attempted and every written response is saved. Then select Submit and finish. This stops the timer, records the completed run in All My Work and updates chapter progress.</li>\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-guide-06\"><strong>Use optional practice only when it helps.</strong> Optional source practice and Practice &amp; Review activities can help you study, but they do not count toward the 12 required chapter checks.</li>\n</ol>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-guide-07\"><strong>Expected work:</strong> complete the lesson and submit the required chapter check. Use optional reading, videos and practice when they help. Drafts save automatically as you work in this browser.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<div class=\"textbook-band\"><div><p class=\"section-label\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-05\">Optional embedded reading</p><p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-06\"><strong>Chapter 11 \u00b7 pp. 393\u2013395</strong></p></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"34\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-07\">Open at p. 393</a></div>\n<p class=\"lesson-term-strip\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-teacher-voice-terms\"><strong>Key terms:</strong> brain stimulation \u00b7 dissection \u00b7 MRI \u00b7 PET</p>\n<details class=\"lesson-vocabulary-help\">\n<summary data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-teacher-voice-vocab-summary\">Vocabulary help</summary>\n<section class=\"lesson-words\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-11-anchor-words\"><p class=\"section-label\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-08\">Key terms</p><h2 id=\"lesson-11-anchor-words\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-09\">Words for this lesson</h2><p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-10\">Use these definitions when you need help with a term.</p><dl>\n<div><dt><button type=\"button\" class=\"bio-term\" data-bio-term=\"evidence\" data-bio-term-route=\"lesson-11\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-11\">evidence</button></dt><dd data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-12\">observations or results used to support an explanation</dd></div>\n<div><dt><button type=\"button\" class=\"bio-term\" data-bio-term=\"claim\" data-bio-term-route=\"lesson-11\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-13\">claim</button></dt><dd data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-14\">a statement or conclusion that can be checked</dd></div>\n<div><dt><button type=\"button\" class=\"bio-term\" data-bio-term=\"mechanism\" data-bio-term-route=\"lesson-11\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-15\">mechanism</button></dt><dd data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-16\">the steps that explain how something happens</dd></div>\n<div><dt><button type=\"button\" class=\"bio-term\" data-bio-term=\"limitation\" data-bio-term-route=\"lesson-11\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-17\">limitation</button></dt><dd data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-18\">what the method or result cannot tell us</dd></div>\n</dl></section>\n<details class=\"lesson-term-inventory\"><summary data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-setup-19\">More vocabulary for this lesson</summary><div><section aria-labelledby=\"lesson-11-all-terms\"><h3 id=\"lesson-11-all-terms\" data-canvas-helper-edit-