  "\n<details class=\"activity-disclosure\">\n<summary data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-check-toggle\">Open chapter check: Studying the brain</summary>\n<section class=\"activity\" data-activity=\"check-brain-investigation\" data-activity-mode=\"paired\" data-required-check=\"\">\n<h2 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-957\">Check: Studying the brain</h2>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-958\">Chapter check \u00b7 Select Start when ready. The elapsed timer includes breaks; Submit and finish stops it. Redo preserves earlier attempts.</p>\n<div class=\"save-row\">\n<button type=\"button\" data-start=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-959\">Start</button>\n<output data-timer=\"\">Not started</output>\n</div>\n<fieldset data-run-body=\"\" disabled=\"\">\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"check-brain-investigation-mc\">\n<h3 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-960\">Which of the following technologies or procedures would not be particularly useful when studying the brain?</h3>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-961\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-brain-investigation-mc\" value=\"QUES_51687_82728_A275535\" data-answer=\"\"> positron-emission tomography (PET) scan</label>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-962\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-brain-investigation-mc\" value=\"QUES_51687_82728_A275536\" data-answer=\"\"> magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) scan</label>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-963\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-brain-investigation-mc\" value=\"QUES_51687_82728_A275537\" data-answer=\"\"> probing areas of the brain while the person remains conscious</label>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-964\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-brain-investigation-mc\" value=\"QUES_51687_82728_A275538\" data-answer=\"\"> X-ray technology</label>\n<button type=\"button\" data-check=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-965\">Check answer</button>\n<p data-feedback=\"\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-966\">\n</p>\n<fieldset class=\"paired-writing\" data-unlock=\"check-brain-investigation-mc\" disabled=\"\">\n<legend>Explain the related idea</legend>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-967\">\nCompare the technologies of MRI and PET for studying the brain. </p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-968\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"35\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-969\">Textbook p. 394</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"check-brain-investigation-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-970\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"check-brain-investigation-written\" data-writing=\"check-brain-investigation-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"check-brain-investigation-written-limit check-brain-investigation-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"check-brain-investigation-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-971\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-972\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"check-brain-investigation-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-973\">\n</p>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-run=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-974\">Submit and finish</button> <button type=\"button\" data-redo=\"\" hidden=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-975\">Redo activity</button>\n<p data-run-status=\"\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-976\">\n</p>\n</section>\n</details>\n<div class=\"content-section\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-979\">Investigation 11.D \u2014 The Brain \u2014 <a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"34\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-980\">Textbook p. 393</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<details class=\"activity-disclosure\">\n<summary data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l11-practice-toggle\">Open optional source practice: Studying the brain</summary>\n<section class=\"activity\" data-activity=\"practice-brain-investigation\" data-activity-mode=\"writing\">\n<h2 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-981\">Source practice: Studying the brain</h2>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-982\">Optional source practice \u00b7 Select Start when ready. The elapsed timer includes breaks; Submit and finish stops it. Redo preserves earlier attempts.</p>\n<div class=\"save-row\">\n<button type=\"button\" data-start=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-983\">Start</button>\n<output data-timer=\"\">Not started</output>\n</div>\n<fieldset data-run-body=\"\" disabled=\"\">\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-checkpoint-26\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-984\">\nDescribe how early researchers studied brain structure and function. </p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-985\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"35\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-986\">Textbook p. 394</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-checkpoint-26-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-987\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-checkpoint-26-written\" data-writing=\"source-checkpoint-26-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-checkpoint-26-written-limit source-checkpoint-26-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-checkpoint-26-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-988\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-989\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-checkpoint-26-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-990\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-review112-q1\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-991\">\nExplain why the brain has elevated requirements for nutrients and oxygen.</p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-992\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"36\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-993\">Textbook p. 395</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-review112-q1-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-994\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-review112-q1-written\" data-writing=\"source-review112-q1-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-review112-q1-written-limit source-review112-q1-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-review112-q1-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-995\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-996\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-review112-q1-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-997\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-review112-q2\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-998\">\nDescribe the three main tissues that support and protect the central nervous system.</p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-999\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"36\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1000\">Textbook p. 395</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-review112-q2-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1001\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-review112-q2-written\" data-writing=\"source-review112-q2-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-review112-q2-written-limit source-review112-q2-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-review112-q2-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1002\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1003\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-review112-q2-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1004\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-review112-q3\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1005\">\nExplain why a physician takes a sample of cerebrospinal fluid to determine if a person has meningitis.</p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1006\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"36\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1007\">Textbook p. 395</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-review112-q3-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1008\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-review112-q3-written\" data-writing=\"source-review112-q3-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-review112-q3-written-limit source-review112-q3-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-review112-q3-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1009\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1010\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-review112-q3-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1011\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-review112-q4\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1012\">\nThe letters on the diagram indicate possible areas of brain damage. In table format, list the possible areas of brain damage (A to G), and describe the functional problems that might result from damage in each area.</p>\n<figure class=\"learning-figure question-figure\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1013\">\n<a class=\"figure-open\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"assets/source/chapter11-brain-investigation-2.png\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1014\">\n<img alt=\"Original diagram for Section 11.2 Review, question 4. Keep these original labels when answering.\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/source/chapter11-brain-investigation-2.png\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1015\">\n</a>\n<figcaption>diagram for Section 11.2 Review, question 4. Keep these original labels when answering.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1016\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"36\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1017\">Textbook p. 395</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-review112-q4-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1018\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-review112-q4-written\" data-writing=\"source-review112-q4-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-review112-q4-written-limit source-review112-q4-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-review112-q4-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1019\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1020\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-review112-q4-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1021\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-review112-q5\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1022\">\nUse graphics software to sketch the cerebral cortex. Use it to identify the lobe that would be stimulated in each situation, and explain why. ICT</p>\n<ol class=\"subquestions\" type=\"a\">\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1023\">Seeing this question.</li>\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1024\">Thinking about this question.</li>\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1025\">Hearing this question read to you by someone else.</li>\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1026\">Reading this question to someone else.</li>\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1027\">Reading this question using Braille.</li>\n</ol>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1028\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"36\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1029\">Textbook p. 395</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-review112-q5-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1030\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-review112-q5-written\" data-writing=\"source-review112-q5-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-review112-q5-written-limit source-review112-q5-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-review112-q5-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1031\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1032\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-review112-q5-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1033\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-review112-q6\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1034\">\nA stroke has caused damage to certain areas of a person\u2019s brain. Upon examination, a doctor notices that the person has difficulty understanding speech and the left side of the body is paralyzed. Identify the specific areas of the brain that are damaged, and explain how this damage might cause the symptoms.</p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1035\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"36\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1036\">Textbook p. 395</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-review112-q6-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1037\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-review112-q6-written\" data-writing=\"source-review112-q6-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-review112-q6-written-limit source-review112-q6-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-review112-q6-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1038\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1039\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-review112-q6-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1040\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-review112-q7\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1041\">\nExplain how MRI and PET scans can be used to improve our understanding of human brain function.</p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1042\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"36\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1043\">Textbook p. 395</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-review112-q7-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-1044\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-review112-q7-written\" data-writing=\"source-review112-q7-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-review112-q7-written-limit source-review112-q7-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-review112-q7-written-limi